&lt;p&gt;The names of created pods often contain some unreadable random strings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you use kubectl to observe logs for individual pods, you need to switch between different pods.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are many tools for this, such as Stern, Kube-tail, and Kail.&lt;/p&gt;
